@page "/"

<PageTitle>Smart-X Gateway</PageTitle>

<div class="hero">
    <h1>Smart-X IoT Mesh Gateway</h1>
    <p>A simulated IoT mesh ecosystem for monitoring hydroponic farms, utility trackers, and smart grid installations. Select a module to continue.</p>
</div>

<div class="pillar-grid">
    <a class="pillar-card active" href="/sensors">
        <span class="pillar-icon">📡</span>
        <h2>Sensor Data Ingestion &amp; Telemetry</h2>
        <p>Register sensors, ingest live telemetry, and monitor readings with proactive anomaly highlighting.</p>
        <span class="pillar-tag">Available</span>
    </a>

    <div class="pillar-card disabled">
        <span class="pillar-icon">⏱</span>
        <h2>Real-Time Command Stream &amp; History</h2>
        <p>Live command dispatch and historical playback across the mesh.</p>
        <span class="pillar-tag">Part 2</span>
    </div>

    <div class="pillar-card disabled">
        <span class="pillar-icon">🕸</span>
        <h2>Network Topology &amp; Mesh Routing</h2>
        <p>Visualise the mesh network and manage routing between nodes.</p>
        <span class="pillar-tag">Final PoE</span>
    </div>
</div>